    <guid isPermaLink="false">69afffe2f3a969043876a553</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Mar 2026 11:32:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🐳本期属于有个鲸喜的「线上分享系列」，主播Henrik与嘉宾Jessica对谈。本期播客邀请到的嘉宾是拿了英国全球人才签的用户体验设计师Jessica，对谈中Jessica分享了她从商科背景转型为产品设计师，并在全球科技行业不断探索的职业经历。从硅谷到伦敦，从大公司、独角兽到AI初创，她讲述了自己如何在不确定的环境中逐渐找到职业方向，并建立对自我的认知与信心。整期节目不仅是一段科技行业的职业故事，也是一场关于成长与选择的对话。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤖嘉宾Jessica：UX/Product Designer，🇺🇸硅谷👉🇬🇧伦敦，互联网大厂➡️独角兽➡️AI初创，英国全球人才签证</span><br><span> </span><br><span>☎️嘉宾可联系：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：不是一只鱼🐟（111554899）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚有个鲸喜在全球范围内线上线下进行书籍知识、有趣话题、商业科技等分享交流，有意加入/合作可联系微信号：15521046410</span></p><span></span><p><span>📱有个鲸喜更多信息关注：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：有个鲸喜MOSTPRISE</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号/视频号：有个鲸喜MOSTPRISE</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a>为什么从商科专业背景转型到UX设计师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a>大公司、独角兽、AI初创的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a>从硅谷来到伦敦的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a>上一家AI初创公司工作的感受</span><br><span> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a>来到现工作的AI初创公司的缘由和产品情况</span><br><span> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3196">53:16</a>美英AI行业的优劣势，如何应对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4103">1:08:23</a>设计在公司/产品中的存在感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4464">1:14:24</a>做满足自己需求的AI工具（油管学习），动机、学习路径、难点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5166">1:26:06</a>1V1咨询服务</span><br><span> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5706">1:35:06</a>欢迎AI产品使用反馈（公司产品网址在下面👇：三分钟处理重复性工作）</span><br><span> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5807">1:36:47</a>书籍推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5994">1:39:54</a>湾区美食推荐</span><br><span> </span><br><span>公司产品官网：</span><a href="https://www.superintern.ai/" data-url="https://www.superintern.ai/"><span>www.superintern.ai</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>公司X账号：<a data-url="https://x.com/super_intern_?s=21&amp;t=2G5wiPZ0HUm8PoSA2RD0ew" href="https://x.com/super_intern_?s=21&amp;t=2G5wiPZ0HUm8PoSA2RD0ew">x.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkmqI-ywMf84pxLx3QJpk518VOzM.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾Jessica</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpEnZ72hquEumklMXxLO4x2nIFFH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Jessica主导设计的AI产品</span></p>]]></description>
